+++ b/specs/adding-todos.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,27 @@
+Feature: Adding todos
+  As a user managing my tasks
+  I want to add new todos by typing and pressing Enter
+  So that I can capture items I need to do
+
+  Rule: A new todo is created from the input field
+
+    Scenario: Entering text and pressing Enter creates a todo
+      Given the app has no todos
+      When the user types "Buy milk" in the new-todo input and presses Enter
+      Then a todo titled "Buy milk" appears in the todo list
+      And the new-todo input is empty
+
+    Scenario: Whitespace-only input does not create a todo
+      Given the app has no todos
+      When the user types "   " in the new-todo input and presses Enter
+      Then no todo is created
+      And the new-todo input is empty
+
+    Scenario: Input is trimmed before creating a todo
+      Given the app has no todos
+      When the user types "  Buy milk  " in the new-todo input and presses Enter
+      Then a todo titled "Buy milk" appears in the todo list
+
+    Scenario: The new-todo input is focused on page load
+      Given the app has no todos
+      Then the new-todo input has focus
diff --git a/specs/completing-todos.feature b/specs/completing-todos.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..986ec09
--- /dev/null
+++ b/specs/completing-todos.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,61 @@
+Feature: Completing todos
+  As a user managing my tasks
+  I want to mark todos as complete or active
+  So that I can track my progress
+
+  Rule: Clicking the toggle checkbox marks a todo complete
+
+    Scenario: Clicking an active todo's checkbox marks it complete
+      Given a todo titled "Buy milk" exists as active
+      When the user clicks the toggle checkbox on the "Buy milk" todo
+      Then the "Buy milk" todo is completed
+
+    Scenario: Clicking a completed todo's checkbox marks it active
+      Given a completed todo titled "Buy milk" exists
+      When the user clicks the toggle checkbox on the "Buy milk" todo
+      Then the "Buy milk" todo is active
+
+  Rule: The toggle-all checkbox controls all todos
+
+    Scenario: Toggling all when some are active checks all todos
+      Given a todo titled "Buy milk" exists as active
+      And a todo titled "Buy eggs" exists as active
+      When the user clicks the toggle-all checkbox
+      Then the "Buy milk" todo is completed
+      And the "Buy eggs" todo is completed
+      And the toggle-all checkbox is checked
+
+    Scenario: Toggling all when all are completed unchecks all todos
+      Given a completed todo titled "Buy milk" exists
+      And a completed todo titled "Buy eggs" exists
+      When the user clicks the toggle-all checkbox
+      Then the "Buy milk" todo is active
+      And the "Buy eggs" todo is active
+      And the toggle-all checkbox is not checked
+
+    Scenario: The toggle-all checkbox reflects the state of all todos
+      Given a completed todo titled "Buy milk" exists
+      And a todo titled "Buy eggs" exists as active
+      Then the toggle-all checkbox is not checked
+
+    Scenario: The toggle-all checkbox is checked when all todos are completed
+      Given a completed todo titled "Buy milk" exists
+      And a completed todo titled "Buy eggs" exists
+      Then the toggle-all checkbox is checked
+
+  Rule: Clear completed removes completed todos
+
+    Scenario: Clicking Clear completed removes completed todos
+      Given a completed todo titled "Buy milk" exists
+      And a todo titled "Buy eggs" exists as active
+      When the user clicks the Clear completed button
+      Then the "Buy milk" todo is removed
+      And the "Buy eggs" todo remains
+
+    Scenario: The Clear completed button is hidden when no todos are completed
+      Given a todo titled "Buy milk" exists as active
+      Then the Clear completed button is hidden
+
+    Scenario: The Clear completed button is visible when todos are completed
+      Given a completed todo titled "Buy milk" exists
+      Then the Clear completed button is visible
diff --git a/specs/display.feature b/specs/display.feature
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..43f1eaf
--- /dev/null
+++ b/specs/display.feature
@@ -0,0 +1,36 @@
+Feature: Todo display
+  As a user managing my tasks
+  I want to see accurate counts and appropriate UI sections
+  So that I can understand my current workload at a glance
+
+  Rule: The item counter shows active todo count
+
+    Scenario: Counter shows zero items when no todos exist
+      Given the app has no todos
+      Then the counter shows "0 items left"
+
+    Scenario: Counter shows singular form for one active todo
+      Given a todo titled "Buy milk" exists as active
+      Then the counter shows "1 item left"
+
+    Scenario: Counter shows plural form for multiple active todos
+      Given a todo titled "Buy milk" exists as active
+      And a todo titled "Buy eggs" exists as active
+      Then the counter shows "2 items left"
+
+    Scenario: Counter counts only active todos
+      Given a completed todo titled "Buy milk" exists
+      And a todo titled "Buy eggs" exists as active
+      Then the counter shows "1 item left"
+
+  Rule: Main and footer are hidden when no todos exist
+
+    Scenario: Main section and footer are hidden when there are no todos
+      Given the app has no todos
+      Then the main section is hidden
+      And the footer is hidden
+
+    Scenario: Main section and footer are visible when todos exist
+      Given a todo titled "Buy milk" exists as active
+      Then the main section is visible
+      And the footer is visible
diff --git a/specs/editing-todos.feature b/specs/editing-todos.feature
new file mode 100644
